    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6892" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνά-λημμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is used for repairing</i> or <i>supporting;
				sling</i> for a wounded limb, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Off.</u>
				23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> any high
				<i>erection</i> or <i>embankment,</i> esp. of
				<i>substructures</i> or <i>retaining-walls</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				2587.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				290
			</span></i> (Delph.), <i><span class="en">
				813
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				5
			</span></i> (Delph.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11.163<i>A</i>38
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Delos</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				165.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				17.71
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				20.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				3.69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.203.21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ. τῆς πόλεως Δαυίδ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ch.</u>
					32.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὑψηλὸν περιβόλου
			ἱεροῦ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Si.</u>
				50.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>sun-dial</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2681
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				9.7.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέρος τι τοῦ ἥπατος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
